OL,3,GNEWSALoss of farm school land to have
OL,4,A'massive impact'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA state secondary boarding school,
OL,7,Fwhich has its own working farm, says
OL,8,Flosing up to 20 acres (eight hectares)
OL,9,Fof the land it uses to teach pupils
OL,10,Fwill have "a massive impact".
OL,12,FBrymore Academy, near Cannington,
OL,13,FSomerset, combines academic subjects
OL,14,Fwith vocational studies and is home to
OL,15,Fdairy and beef cattle, as well as sheep
OL,16,Fand poultry.
OL,18,FThe all-boys school has been told an
OL,19,Farea of land it currently leases from a
OL,20,Flandowner is set to go up for sale and
OL,21,Fwill not be available from next
OL,22,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
