OL,3,GNEWSALoss of farm school land to have
OL,4,A'massive impact'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKerry Marks, the head of agriculture,
OL,7,Fsaid: "We've leased the parcel of land
OL,8,Ffor the last 20 years and it's now
OL,9,Funfortunately up for sale. It will have
OL,10,Fa massive impact on what we can
OL,11,Factually deliver."
